## External prerequisites — not redistributed

qpdf 12.4.0: EXTERNAL PREREQUISITE / NOT REDISTRIBUTED.
Users obtain and install qpdf from the official project and make it available
on PATH. PDF Tools checks the reported version before every invocation.
Official release: https://github.com/qpdf/qpdf/releases/tag/v12.4.0
Official distribution guidance:
https://github.com/qpdf/qpdf/blob/v12.4.0/README-what-to-download.md
qpdf's licensing applies to the user's separately obtained qpdf distribution.
PDF Tools does not ship qpdf.exe, qpdf30.dll, upstream runtime manifests,
native library files, or qpdf vendor license/documentation files.

Microsoft VC Runtime: NOT REDISTRIBUTED.
PDF Tools does not ship concrt140.dll, msvcp140.dll, msvcp140_1.dll,
msvcp140_2.dll, msvcp140_atomic_wait.dll, msvcp140_codecvt_ids.dll,
vcruntime140.dll or vcruntime140_1.dll. Requirements and licensing for the
separately installed qpdf distribution are handled through its official provider.
This notice does not grant Microsoft redistribution rights.

Node.js, npm and Windows are also external prerequisites and not redistributed.

